 [3] Bad input: header validation (magic 0x4E50) + SO_RCVTIMEO/SO_SNDTIMEO
==============================================================================
Scenario: garbage = an HTTP request instead of an NP header
          biglen  = a valid header claiming body_len = 0xFFFFFFFF
          idle    = connect and send nothing
          each client keeps its socket open for 8 s, waiting for a reaction

