==============================================================================
 Summary: WITHOUT vs WITH
==============================================================================
 Mechanism                            | WITHOUT (switched off)                | WITH (default)
--------------------------------------+---------------------------------------+---------------------------------------
 [1]  SIGCHLD + waitpid(WNOHANG)      | 12 zombie children                    | 0 zombie children
 [1b] waitpid loop (signals coalesce) | 28 zombies after 30 exits             | 0 zombies after 30 exits
 [2]  SIG_IGN(SIGPIPE) + EPIPE check  | 3 children killed by SIGPIPE          | 3 children exit 4 after EPIPE
 [3]  header check + SO_RCVTIMEO      | 3 children stuck, 3 unanswered        | 0 children left, 3/3 answered
 [4]  connection limit + per IP       | 20 children for one host              | 5 children, 127.0.0.2 served
 [5]  whole-request deadline          | 1 child still waiting at 6.5 s        | 0 children, cut off at 5 s (error 8)
 [6]  stream framing (read_n)         | split: 0/1 ok, glued: 1/5             | split: 1/1 ok, glued: 5/5
 [7]  heartbeat (ACK per push)        | 1 child pushing to a frozen client    | 0 children, ended at 3 s (error 7)
 [8]  client reconnect + backoff      | client exited                         | client running, 2 server pids
 [9]  PR_SET_PDEATHSIG                | 3 orphans after kill -9               | 0 orphans after kill -9

